{"id":"01M4GAK6V7HBBR5WQ1KGDM609C","t":5,"a":"83a1","op":"comment","body":"Tickets of `siren-sequence-diagram-slice`:\n\n- 01: `01M4GAK4C7Y68PHFXD1AK0GA51` — Freeze sequence-diagram contracts and parse core syntax (participants, all 10 arrows, title, autonumber)\n- 02: `01M4GAK4GA7NRFX8DDW76Y8DSA` — Resolve a parsed core sequence document into a validated SequenceModel\n- 03: `01M4GAK4MFWD1NC7FFZPZXF0PD` — Lay out a core sequence diagram: lanes, lifelines, message positions\n- 04: `01M4GAK4RK9Q1NJ22JXNM6GNNX` — Render a core sequence diagram to SVG\n- 05: `01M4GAK4WNJR966DF250K8S5C4` — Wire core sequence diagrams into render() end to end, add demo\n- 06: `01M4GAK50V5VGHHDV4XJ6ECDG6` — Parse nested control-flow blocks (loop, alt/else, opt, par/and, critical/option, break, rect)\n- 07: `01M4GAK54ZC8990E76NYNGJ1ZC` — Resolve nested control-flow blocks into the SequenceModel\n- 08: `01M4GAK594EXWFD82QF9SDHWPJ` — Lay out nested control-flow block bounding boxes\n- 09: `01M4GAK5D8C9Z4973WD5X516DT` — Render control-flow block frames, branch dividers, and rect background highlight\n- 10: `01M4GAK5HTNHSFKQ5Y8VB23DWF` — Wire control-flow blocks into render() end to end, extend demo\n- 11: `01M4GAK5NYGC0A84YNF30VQ3H6` — Parse create/destroy participant statements and box groupings\n- 12: `01M4GAK5T3P8NKASGG647XHYWN` — Resolve participant lifeline extents (create/destroy) and box groupings\n- 13: `01M4GAK5Y65KG9M0V6HKC2RKKE` — Lay out truncated lifelines and box-group backgrounds\n- 14: `01M4GAK62A0TSBJYXW3ZBWFDR6` — Render destroy markers and box-group backgrounds\n- 15: `01M4GAK66FWPRM89SZ315D8E1Q` — Wire create/destroy/box into render() end to end, finalize demo\n- 16: `01M4GAK6AMMD47ZK71018AJ4T7` — Render the bottom participant box row\n- 17: `01M4GAK6ESTD3SCJB4C7DX3MCW` — Fix the top participant row overlapping the first message\n- 18: `01M4GAK6JX7H0H2G7PTXYARC5X` — Give the sequence diagram its default theme\n- 19: `01M4GAK6Q250SD4MZJ6ETDWJNX` — Fix the actor label printing through the stick figure"}
